@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "应用代码" as App
participant "SqlSession" as SqlSession
participant "Configuration" as Config
participant "InterceptorChain" as Chain
participant "CachingExecutor\n(二级缓存装饰器)" as CachingExec
participant "BaseExecutor\n(一级缓存/Simple)" as BaseExec
participant "PageInterceptor\n(PageHelper)" as PageHelper
participant "StatementHandler\n(可能被代理)" as StmtHandler
participant "ParameterHandler\n(可能被代理)" as ParamHandler
participant "ResultSetHandler\n(可能被代理)" as RsHandler
participant "TypeHandler" as TypeHandler
participant "Transaction" as Tx
participant "Database" as DB

note over App
  <b>扩展点1：Mapper接口与XML映射</b>
  开发者定义接口与SQL，由MapperRegistry注册
end note

App -> SqlSession: selectList(statementId, param)
SqlSession -> Config: getMappedStatement(statementId)
Config --> SqlSession: MappedStatement (包含SQL等元数据)

SqlSession -> Config: newExecutor(transaction, executorType)
activate Config
Config -> Config: 创建 BaseExecutor (Simple/Reuse/Batch)
Config -> Config: 若 cacheEnabled 包装为 CachingExecutor
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(executor)
activate Chain
note right of Chain
  <b>扩展点2：插件代理拦截器</b>
  遍历所有 Interceptor，使用 Plugin.wrap 生成代理类。
end note
Chain --> Config: 返回代理后的 Executor
deactivate Chain
Config --> SqlSession: Executor Proxy
deactivate Config

SqlSession -> CachingExec: query(MappedStatement, param, ...)
activate CachingExec

note over CachingExec
  若被 PageHelper 拦截，实际先执行 PageInterceptor.intercept()
end note

CachingExec -> PageHelper: intercept(invocation)
activate PageHelper
PageHelper -> PageHelper: 从 ThreadLocal 获取分页参数
note right of PageHelper
  <b>PageHelper 核心扩展逻辑：</b>
  1. 执行 count 查询计算总数。
  2. 获取原 BoundSql。
  3. 修改 SQL 拼接 LIMIT/OFFSET。
  4. 将修改后的 BoundSql 覆盖回 MappedStatement。
end note
PageHelper -> CachingExec: invocation.proceed() (执行改写后的查询)
deactivate PageHelper

CachingExec -> CachingExec: 获取 Cache，查二级缓存
note right of CachingExec
  <b>二级缓存机制：</b>
  命中则直接返回。未命中则查DB。
  查询结果暂存到 TransactionalCache 中，
  待 Session commit() 时才真正刷入二级缓存。
end note

CachingExec -> BaseExec: query(ms, parameter, ..., boundSql)
activate BaseExec

BaseExec -> BaseExec: 查询一级缓存 (PerpetualCache)
note right of BaseExec
  <b>一级缓存机制：</b>
  基于 Executor 的本地 HashMap。
  增删改操作或 flushCache=true 会清空该缓存。
end note

BaseExec -> Config: newStatementHandler(executor, ms, parameter, ...)
activate Config
Config -> Config: 创建 RoutingStatementHandler (路由到 Simple/Prepared/Callable)
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(statementHandler)
Config --> BaseExec: 返回代理后的 StatementHandler
deactivate Config

BaseExec -> StmtHandler: prepare(connection, transactionTimeout)
activate StmtHandler

StmtHandler -> Tx: getConnection()
activate Tx
Tx -> DB: 获取 java.sql.Connection
DB --> Tx: Connection
Tx --> StmtHandler: Connection
deactivate Tx

StmtHandler -> DB: prepare(Connection, SQL)
DB --> StmtHandler: java.sql.PreparedStatement

BaseExec -> Config: newParameterHandler(ms, parameter, boundSql)
activate Config
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(parameterHandler)
Config --> BaseExec: 返回代理后的 ParameterHandler
deactivate Config

BaseExec -> ParamHandler: setParameters(preparedStatement)
activate ParamHandler
note over ParamHandler, TypeHandler
  <b>扩展点3：ParameterHandler & TypeHandler</b>
  设置参数时，TypeHandler 负责将 Java 类型转为 JDBC 类型。
end note
ParamHandler -> TypeHandler: setParameter(ps, i, parameter, jdbcType)
TypeHandler -> DB: stmt.setXxx(i, value)
deactivate ParamHandler

StmtHandler -> DB: execute()
DB --> StmtHandler: executeQuery() -> ResultSet

BaseExec -> Config: newResultSetHandler(executor, ms, parameterHandler, ...)
activate Config
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(resultSetHandler)
Config --> BaseExec: 返回代理后的 ResultSetHandler
deactivate Config

BaseExec -> RsHandler: handleResultSets(preparedStatement)
activate RsHandler
note over RsHandler
  <b>扩展点4：ResultSetHandler</b>
  负责将 JDBC ResultSet 映射为 Java 对象集合。
  可在此拦截处理结果集映射。
end note
RsHandler --> BaseExec: 返回 List<E> 结果
deactivate RsHandler
deactivate StmtHandler

BaseExec -> BaseExec: 将结果存入一级缓存
BaseExec --> CachingExec: 返回查询结果
deactivate BaseExec

CachingExec -> CachingExec: 将结果暂存至二级缓存 (TransactionalCacheManager)
CachingExec --> SqlSession: 返回查询结果
deactivate CachingExec

SqlSession --> App: 返回结果

@enduml